<title>FRANCE: France outlines bids for EU free-mkt wheat, barley.</title>
<headline>France outlines bids for EU free-mkt wheat, barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following free market bids through France at this week's EU tender, French cereals office (ONIC) said.</p>
<p>All bids are for refunds, in Ecus per tonne.</p>
<p>			--- Oct 3 ---		 --- Sept 26---</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p>MAIN TENDER</p>
<p> Soft wheat  692,050    4.37-11.37	657,750    4.47-12.99</p>
<p> Barley	359,300   28.80-36.65	496,000   29.77-38.47</p>
<p> Rye	    10,000   Not given	    6,000   Not given</p>
<p>ACP TENDER</p>
<p> Soft wheat    7,500   Not given	    4,500   Not given</p>
</text>
